{"seq":21,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:13:55.011Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f1153afd5f527557a0f9289bc199943d5a949399c1d4c38184ddcd11076d8fda","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, I found five ticket references for Vantorre Group (the parent, not Mobility). None of them come with a full ticket history, and the sources disagree on one number. I couldn't see an `accounts/vantorre-group/tickets` folder in the share listing, so the actual ticket records aren't included here.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n1. **#8841**, carrier kiosk / gate check-in issue\n   - #strategic-pod, 1 Jul 2026, 09:17 (Gideon): says he closed it out with support.\n   - Moss digest 5/4/2026 (`teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-05-04-strategic-digest.md`): open, gate kiosk timeout at Allentown, Dock Door 12.\n   - Moss digest 9/30/2026 (`teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-09-30-strategic-digest.md`): Mateo submitted it, Newark, Dock Door 14 on the check-in kiosk, escalated to platform engineering.\n2. **#PD-8841**, missed carrier check-ins at Allentown Gate 4, 2nd shift\n   - Moss digest 4/27/2026 (`2026-04-27-strategic-digest.md`).\n   - This may be the same issue as #8841, but the digests don't say so.\n3. **INC-4821**, Hartford gate kiosk outage (status-page access)\n   - #inc-vtg-hartford, 3 Aug 2026, 11:08 (Gideon): both lanes working, left open, screenshot attached to the ticket.\n4. **VT-55120**, root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage\n   - #inc-vtg-hartford, 14 Oct 2026, 09:00 (Gideon), with a reply from me that same time.\n5. **#PD-4418**, `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export dropping timestamps at Dock Door 9\n   - Moss digest 9/15/2025 (`2025-09-15-strategic-digest.md`).\n   - The digest says \"the account Nadia runs\" without naming it, so please confirm it's Vantorre Group and not another account of yours.\n\n**Left out**\n- #4812 (Vantorre Mobility, March 2025, from the 3/10/2025 digest).\n- #PD-4402 (Quillfeather Outfitters).\n\n**Gaps and conflicts**\n- #8841 has three different descriptions across the sources, and the 1 Jul \"closed\" note doesn't match the September escalation. Someone who owns the ticket should confirm its current status before it goes into the steering committee history.\n- The 3/10/2025 digest mentions a Vantorre Group email about gate delays but gives no ticket number.\n- I didn't check any ticket system directly. Everything above comes from these channels and digests."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
